# One regex per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# Matching is case-insensitive.
#
# Copy this file to pii_patterns.local (gitignored) and replace the
# placeholders with the real values you want screened out of the binary
# fixtures: your surname, handles, phone numbers, document numbers.
#
# Keep the real file OUT of version control. It is a list of your personal
# data by construction, so committing it publishes exactly what the sweep
# exists to catch.

your-surname
your-handle
your-email@example.com
[0-9]{7,11}
